THIRD-PARTY LICENCES
====================

This file applies to the "-full" builds of Honey, I Shrunk the Vids,
which bundle FFmpeg and FFprobe binaries alongside the application.
The standard builds do not include FFmpeg.


FFmpeg
------

FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), version n8.1.1, is built with --enable-gpl
and --enable-version3 and linked with GPL-licensed libraries (x264 and
x265), so the bundled ffmpeg and ffprobe binaries are distributed under
the GNU General Public Licence version 3 or later (GPLv3+). The full
licence text is in FFMPEG-LICENSE.txt, next to this file (in the Flatpak:
/app/share/licenses/ffmpeg/LICENSE.txt).

The binaries are histv's own static builds. They are compiled from the
unmodified upstream source of FFmpeg and each library below; no patches
are applied.

Libraries compiled into the binaries (versions as pinned in the build
recipe; the licence file read at each pinned version is in brackets):

  x264 (commit b35605ace3dd, stable branch)
      GPL v2 or later [COPYING, x264.h header]
  x265 4.2
      GPL v2 or later [COPYING, source/x265.h header]
  SVT-AV1 v3.1.2
      BSD 3-Clause Clear, plus the Alliance for Open Media Patent
      License 1.0 [LICENSE.md, PATENTS.md]
  dav1d 1.5.5
      BSD 2-Clause [COPYING]
  zimg release-3.0.5
      WTFPL version 2 [COPYING]
  Opus 1.6.1
      BSD 3-Clause [COPYING]
  libogg 1.3.6 and libvorbis 1.3.7
      BSD 3-Clause [COPYING in each]
  LAME 3.100
      LGPL v2 or later [COPYING (GNU Library General Public License
